  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n‘ReRoad’ is a Tower Defense game with a brand new concept where the players dig their own paths.<p></p>\n<p>You need to consider the locations of the randomly placed towers of the stages as well as the towers you will build and strategically create a path.</p>\n<p><b>A battle to find the enemy’s origin.</b><br>\nThere isn’t enough power to wipe out all the enemies at once.</p>\n<p>You must lure the enemies out little by little to strengthen your power and gather information about them.</p>\n<p>Killing powerful enemies might give you a clue as to why the robots have gone rogue.</p>\n<p><b>Tactical Retreat</b><br>\nOnce the Decoy is destroyed, you must start the battle again from the first scouting zone.</p>\n<p>But don’t give up yet.</p>\n<p>If you understand the enemies’ attributes in each scouting zone and apply a strategy, you’ll be able to kill more enemies.</p>\n",
